ModuleDex Odoo Addons — Licensing
=================================

This repository contains modules released under DIFFERENT licenses. There is no
single license covering the whole repository. The authoritative license for each
module is the `license` key in its `__manifest__.py`, and the full license text
is in that module's own LICENSE file.

  Module                       License   Text
  ---------------------------  --------  ---------------------------------------
  mdx_external_id_finder       LGPL-3    mdx_external_id_finder/LICENSE
  mdx_security_simulator       LGPL-3    mdx_security_simulator/LICENSE
  data_insight_workbench       OPL-1     data_insight_workbench/LICENSE

LGPL-3 modules are free software: you may use, modify and redistribute them
under the terms of the GNU Lesser General Public License version 3.

OPL-1 modules are proprietary. They are published under the Odoo Proprietary
License v1.0 and may only be used if you have purchased a valid license, which
is normally obtained through the Odoo Apps Store:

  https://apps.odoo.com/apps/modules/browse?author=ModuleDex

The presence of the source code in this repository does not grant any right to
use, redistribute or resell the OPL-1 modules. See each module's LICENSE file
for the exact terms.

